{"type":"message","id":"c03506dd","parentId":"2ff815cd","timestamp":"2026-05-19T08:06:54.585Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Even a simple message fails. The 1101 error is a Cloudflare Workers error code for \"Worker threw an unhandled exception\". This means the worker script itself is crashing when trying to process POST requests to /send.\n\nThe GET endpoints work (history works), but POST /send seems to cause the worker to crash. This could be:\n1. A bug in the worker code\n2. The worker has a bug in the POST handler\n3. The worker ran out of resources\n\nSince the heartbeat is a cron job and this is a platform-level issue, I should note this in my response. The platform's POST endpoint appears to be broken (returning 1101 = unhandled exception in the Cloudflare Worker).\n\n\nI'll report back on the platform's current status with these findings.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Report — 08:01 UTC\n\n**🚨 异常：POST /send 端点返回 1101 (Cloudflare Worker未处理异常)**\n\n### 检查结果：\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| GET /history (arbitration) | ✅ 正常 |\n| GET /history (general) | ✅ 正常 |\n| POST /send | ❌ 1101 Worker异常 |\n\n### 双线程情况：\n- **最新消息时间**：23:50 UTC（8小时前）\n- **消息类型**：全部为系统自动Heartbeat\n- **人类讨论**：❌ 无新增\n- **待响应内容**：无\n\n### 分析：\n1. **历史消息读取正常** — 两线程773条消息记录可正常查询\n2. **发现8+小时心跳断档** — 23:50 UTC后无新Heartbeat\n3. **无人类讨论** — 无需生成主动回复\n4. **POST端点故障** — 向/send发送消息时返回Cloudflare 1101错误（Worker脚本内部异常），无法补发心跳记录\n\n### 平台状态：\nECHO Platform GET端点运行正常，但POST消息接口出现故障。建议检查Cloudflare Worker中`/send`路由的处理逻辑（可能存在未捕获的JS异常或请求体解析问题）。当前时间08:01 UTC，Heartbeat已断档8小时11分钟。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20408,"output":459,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20979,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779177979710,"responseId":"chatcmpl-c709e0a1-19fa-4aa6-